{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emma's Umbrella</strong> is a precision 2D platformer where you help Emma overcome challenges to find her way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f <strong>An Unexpected Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a rainy day, Emma was leaving school when she accidentally fell into the sewers. Now, our little adventurer must face dangerous challenges, master agile movements, and use her umbrella in creative ways to escape this underground labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/Umbrella04.gif?t=1740931247\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/OpenUmbrella.gif?t=1740931247\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/TestLoading.gif?t=1740931247\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2602\ufe0f <strong>Master Emma\u2019s Umbrella</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emma\u2019s umbrella isn\u2019t just for the rain\u2014it\u2019s her main survival tool! Use it in unique ways to overcome obstacles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dash</strong> \u2013 A quick burst of speed to cross gaps or avoid hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Float</strong> \u2013 Glide smoothly with the umbrella to control jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hang</strong> \u2013 Grab onto pipes to reach new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Umbrella Platform</strong> \u2013 Shoot the umbrella into the air and use it as a temporary platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wall Jump</strong> \u2013 Jump between walls to reach higher places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jump</strong> \u2013 Perform precise jumps to avoid traps and dangers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/WalkDash.gif?t=1740931247\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/Emma-Floating.gif?t=1740931247\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/SuspendedPipe.gif?t=1740931247\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/ShootUmbrella.gif?t=1740931247\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precision platforming</strong> with responsive controls and challenging mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fluid movement</strong> and a variety of abilities to explore the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong>, blending beauty and mystery in underground tunnels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic challenges</strong>, requiring creativity and mastery of Emma\u2019s skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Emma find her way home before the rain stops?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489990?t=1740931247","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740931247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/39e7d357962fde38625fd107db4f8dc13cffa3b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740931247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/39e7d357962fde38625fd107db4f8dc13cffa3b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740931247","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full