ll Jump</strong> \u2013 Jump between walls to reach higher places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jump</strong> \u2013 Perform precise jumps to avoid traps and dangers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/WalkDash.gif?t=1740931247\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/Emma-Floating.gif?t=1740931247\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/SuspendedPipe.gif?t=1740931247\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/extras/ShootUmbrella.gif?t=1740931247\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precision platforming</strong> with responsive controls and challenging mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fluid movement</strong> and a variety of abilities to explore the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong>, blending beauty and mystery in underground tunnels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic challenges</strong>, requiring creativity and mastery of Emma\u2019s skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Emma find her way home before the rain stops?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Marcus Vinicius Moreira Maria"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489990/header.jpg?t=1740931247","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257092165,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257092165/movie480.mp4?t=1740931245","max":"http://video.akamai.ste